msgstr "如果输入文件为 -，则将读取标准输入。\n"

#: src/msgcat.c:401 src/msgcomm.c:397
#, c-format
msgid ""
"  -<, --less-than=NUMBER      print messages with less than this many\n"
"                              definitions, defaults to infinite if not set\n"
msgstr ""
"  -<, --less-than=数字        只打印出现次数少于指定次数的消息，若没有\n"
"                              指定次数则默认值为无穷大\n"

#: src/msgcat.c:404
#, c-format
